{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pulls/12109","id":4126874359,"node_id":"PR_kwDOOCjvss71-xr3","html_url":"https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12109","diff_url":"https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12109.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12109.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dynamo/dynamo/issues/12109","number":12109,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(glm52): chat template parity fixes — arguments normalization and streaming tool_call recovery","user":{"login":"peilii","id":76031090,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MDMxMDkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76031090?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/peilii","html_url":"https://github.com/peilii","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peilii/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peilii/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peilii/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peilii/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peilii/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peilii/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peilii/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peilii/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peilii/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\n- **Fix: tool_calls[*].function.arguments JSON string → dict before MiniJinja render** — GLM-5.2 Jinja template iterates arguments with \\`{% for k, v in _args.items() %}\\` which requires a dict; the wire schema stores arguments as a JSON-object string. Added \\`normalize_tool_call_arguments()\\` shared helper in \\`preprocessor/prompt.rs\\`, called from both \\`NvCreateChatCompletionRequest::messages()\\` (the \\`/v1/chat/completions\\` path RWLT uses) and \\`UnifiedRequest::messages()\\`.\n\n- **Fix: streaming glm47 truncated tool_call → preserve as content** — When \\`max_tokens\\` is hit mid-\\`<tool_call>\\` block, \\`glm47_parser\\` drops the block silently (\\`allow_eof_recovery=false\\`). Added content-recovery to the streaming jail path in \\`preprocessor.rs::apply_tool_calling_jail()\\`: buffers input text, detects \\`finish_reason=length\\` with no tool_calls output, and emits the dropped text as a synthetic content chunk before the finish. Also covers the non-streaming aggregation path in \\`aggregator.rs\\`.\n\n## Context\n\nDiscovered during GLM-5.2 NVfp4 GB300 RWLT benchmarking. Dynamo showed ~3K fewer ISL tokens and shorter OSL vs TRT-LLM on identical trajectories. OSL gap included 1315 truncated tool_call drops per SLO50 run (confirmed from frontend logs) and Dynamo prose-before-tool fraction of 24% vs TRT-LLM 88%. The streaming fix matches TRT-LLM behavior where partial XML is returned as content rather than silently dropped.\n\nCompanion fix in AA repo: \\`peili/dynamo_conv_routing@767073e\\` (AgentPerf \\`setdefault\\` for \\`reasoning_content\\`).\n\n## Test plan\n- [ ] Rebuild image from this branch\n- [ ] Parity test: compare \\`server_input_tokens\\` on shared (conversation_id, conversation_idx, turn) pairs between Dynamo and TRT-LLM\n- [ ] Confirm truncated tool_call drop warnings go to 0 in frontend logs\n- [ ] Confirm ISL gap narrows with AA reasoning_content fix active\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/claude-code)\n<!-- devin-review-badge-begin -->\n\n---\n\n<a href=\"https://nvidia.devinenterprise.com/review/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/12109\" target=\"_blank\">\n  <picture>\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://static.devin.ai/assets/gh-open-in-devin-review-dark.svg?v=1\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.devin.ai/assets/gh-open-in-devin-review-light.svg?v=1\" alt=\"Open in Devin Review\">\n  </picture>\n</a>\n<!-- devin-review-badge-end -->","created_at":"2026-07-24T18:10:52Z","updated_at":"2026-09-29T01:07:22Z","closed_at":"2026-09-29T01:07:22Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":8236034630,"node_id":"LA_kwDOOCjvss8AAAAB6ufqRg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dynamo/dynamo/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","color":"0075ca","default":true,"description":"Improvements or additions to documentation","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8461525019,"node_id":"LA_kwDOOCjvss8AAAAB-FigGw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dynamo/dynamo/labels/size/XL","name":"size/XL","color":"C32607","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8462105806,"node_id":"LA_kwDOOCjvss8AAAAB-GF8zg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dynamo/dynamo/labels/backend::vllm","name":"backend::vllm","color":"E99695","default":false,"description":"Relates to the vllm backend","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8467608579,"node_id":"LA_kwDOOCjvss8AAAAB-LV0Aw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dynamo/dynamo/labels/deployment::k8s","name":"deployment::k8s","color":"1d76db","default":false,"description":"Relates to dynamo deployment in kubernetes","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8582537231,"node_id":"LA_kwDOOCjvss8AAAAB_48gDw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dynamo/dynamo/labels/fix","name":"fix","color":"158c01","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":9062230649,"node_id":"LA_kwDOOCjvss8AAAACHCaqeQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dynamo/dynamo/labels/backend::sglang","name":"backend::sglang","color":"E99695","default":false,"description":"Relates to the sglang backend","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":9138089909,"node_id":"LA_kwDOOCjvss8AAAACIKwvtQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ai-dynamo/dynamo/labels/backend::trtllm","name":"backend::trtllm","color":"E99695","default":false,"description":"Relates to the trtllm backend","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"i